apps/mediamake/docs/random/*
# Local Claude Code settings stay out of git (.claude/settings.local.json). Two exceptions:
# skills are all public, so .claude/skills (links to .agents/skills/) is committed in full (see
# tools/skills.mjs), and .claude/settings.json holds the guard rails every session
# runs (see tools/guard-rails.json).
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.json

# Unreleased MCPs and apps live here, never in git. Release them to private
# storage with `npm run catalog -- release private/mcps/<name>.mcpb`.
/private/*
!/private/README.md

# Built, never committed, so pulls and branch switches never meet an edited copy:
# skills.json is the skills registry (node tools/skills.mjs index; the site's build and dev server
# write it), and the studio's mediamake presets come from apps/mediamake (mm builds them when their
# sources change: apps/studio/scripts/generated.mjs). SKILLS.md was the old committed index.
/skills.json
/SKILLS.md
/apps/studio/src/mediamake/presets.json
/apps/studio/src/mediamake/html-text.ts
/apps/studio/src/mediamake/.presets.inputs.json
